      "name": "Find",
      "summary": "Find uses binary search to find and return the smallest index i in [0, n) at which cmp(i) <= 0. If there is no such index i, Find returns i = n. The found result is true if i < n and cmp(i) == 0. Find calls cmp(i) only for i in the range [0, n).",
